# The repo root IS the deployment root, so anything committed here is fetchable
# unless listed below. Measured on production 2026-07-31: /scripts/*.mjs returned
# 200 on several properties, publishing internal tooling and, on the generated
# sites, the entire page template.
#
# THE TRAP: once this file exists, `vercel deploy` reads it INSTEAD of
# .gitignore. Every exclusion .gitignore was silently providing has to be
# restated here — .env* above all, which is why the .env and .vercel lines are
# not redundant.
#
# This is a deny list on purpose. An allow list would have to remember
# package.json, which is what makes api/*.js ESM; drop it and every serverless
# function fails to parse.

# Internal documentation.
*.md
docs/

# Test suites and operational tooling.
scripts/

# Local configuration and captured state.
.mcp.json
.env
.env.*
.vercel
